<!-- 107 the gallery east of the main hall.
     - The statue holds the 1F map out of reach. The step (object 0, yaw 0,
       so it is climbed from its east face, looking west) goes north until it
       is level with the statue, then west until the statue stops it; from on
       top the pickup over the statue (item AOT 2) is live. In the retail
       game AOT 2 has no zone (an event hands the map over) and the map opens
       nothing, so the two steps hold only for a randomized game, which may
       put a key there.
     - The cabinet (object 1) stands in the mouth of the passage round the
       corner to the shelf (item AOT 3, item bit 39). Pushed east it wedges
       in the mouth; pushed north it stops with too little room to pass. It
       goes south, from its north side, until it is level with the painting
       on the east wall (message AOT 16), which leaves the mouth open and the
       door to 108 clear. It is back in place on every entry. -->
<bot format="2">
  <push object="0" slot="2" uncovers="2" axis="z" bank="7" bit="145" done="clear" when="items=random"
        label="the step north, level with the statue"/>
  <climb object="0" slot="2" bank="7" bit="145" done="clear" when="items=random"
         label="what the statue holds"/>
  <push object="1" slot="16" uncovers="3" axis="z" bank="7" bit="39" done="clear" when="items=random"
        label="the cabinet south, off the passage round the corner"/>
</bot>
